     <td style=\"width:400px;\">\n              \n      <img height=\"auto\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/msgsndr/oKvxmpgImkZb3TwM9ii4/media/667c7b5ab458d55a15346991.jpeg\" style=\"border:0;display:block;outline:none;text-decoration:none;height:auto;width:100%;font-size:13px;\" width=\"400\">\n    \n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n          </tbody>\n\n        </table>\n    \n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    \n      </div>\n    \n          <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:600px;\" width=\"600\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" ><tr><td style=\"line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\"><![endif]-->\n    \n      \n     \n    <div style=\"overflow:hidden;\">\n      <div style=\"background:#ffffff;background-color:#ffffff;border-width:0px;margin:0px auto 0px auto;border-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;max-width:600px;\">\n        \n        <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background:#ffffff;background-color:#ffffff;width:100%;border-radius:0px;\">\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td style=\"padding:20px 0;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-top:10px;border-color:transparent;direction:ltr;font-size:0px;text-align:center;\">\n                <!--[if mso | IE]><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td class=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:top;width:560px;\" ><![endif]-->\n            \n      <div class=\"mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix\" style=\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;\">\n        \n      <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\">\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"vertical-align:top;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;\">\n              \n    <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"\" width=\"100%\">\n          <tbody>\n            \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"center\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <p style=\"border-top:solid 2px rgba(242, 247, 250, 1);font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:100%;\">\n      </p>\n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-top:solid 2px rgba(242, 247, 250, 1);font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:520px;\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"520px\" ><tr><td style=\"height:0;line-height:0;\"> &nbsp;\n</td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n    \n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <div style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.25;text-align:left;color:#000000;\"><h2 style=\"margin-top: 14pt;margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Promissory Notes: Boring Name, Sexy Deal Tool</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Hi Sara,</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">If you\u2019re buying or selling a business, you\u2019ve probably met our friend: the promissory note.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Sounds dull. It\u2019s anything but.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">A promissory note is a promise to pay. Groundbreaking, I know. But before you tune out, here\u2019s why it matters: when used right, it can make the difference between a deadlocked deal and one that gets across the finish line.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Here\u2019s what you need to know\u2014without needing a law degree:</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">You want $1.2 million for your business. The buyer\u2019s stuck on $1 million. Enter: the promissory note. That extra $200K? It can live in a note, payable <em>if</em> the business performs post-closing. It\u2019s called a retention adjustment, and it\u2019s basically the deal version of \u201clet\u2019s see who\u2019s right.\u201d</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">But don\u2019t stop there.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">You can slice and dice a note like a Vegas card shark. $500K note? Make $50K of it the SBA-required \u201cequity injection\u201d (hello, 24-month standby). Carve the rest into separate notes with different terms. The bank cares about how the equity portion of the Note is structured, but may have different (and more lenient) thoughts on the other parts.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Why I Like Notes More Than Earn-Outs if I\u2019m the Buyer</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Earn-outs are needy. They involve escrow agents, agreements, arguments, and fees. Notes? You just draft them, sign them, and boom\u2014you\u2019re off to the races. They\u2019re elegant. They\u2019re manageable. And they don\u2019t come with a customer service line.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">If you\u2019re a busy business owner\u2014and most of my clients are\u2014this kind of simplicity matters. Notes let you build in conditional payments without the administrative circus of a full-blown earn-out. We love that.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">*But ON THE OTHER HAND, if I\u2019m the seller, I certainly like the fact that my money is sitting in an escrow account somewhere.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>One Last Note (Get It?)</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Don't treat notes like a monolith. Be strategic. Use multiple notes. Tailor the terms. And above all: stop pretending like \u201cstandard terms\u201d are your only option. You can (and should) get creative.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Want help using deal tools that actually <em>work</em>?</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/ce117cfff67?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn\"><span style=\"color: #3425db !important; font-size: 14px; color: #3425db !important\">Check out Deal Academy</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">. It\u2019s the stuff they don\u2019t teach you in business school\u2014but maybe should.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">To smarter structuring,<br>Sara Sharp<br>Partner, SK&amp;S Law Group</span></p></div>\n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <div style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.25;text-align:left;color:#000000;\"><p>For more helpful lessons from Deal Academy, check out our <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/b973d3841c1?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn\"><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 37, 219); color: rgb(52, 37, 219)\">Dealmakers Youtube Channel </span></a>where you'll find Sara's <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/c17080d8363?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn&amp;v=csIoWCXhXsE&amp;t=15s\" title=\"Weekly Wine Down\"><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 37, 219); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(52, 37, 219)\">Weekly Wine 